Description: Ubuntu account, YubiKey, and hardening manager
 Multi Settings is a native GTK 4 application for creating local accounts,
 enrolling primary and secondary YubiKeys, enforcing password plus YubiKey
 authentication, and auditing or applying DevSec OS and SSH hardening on
 Ubuntu 26.04.
